2
00:02:45,454 --> 00:02:51,174
高鳴る心臓に祈りを乗せて 曖昧な夢を描く
With prayers on my beating heart, I sketch an ambiguous dream

3
00:02:51,274 --> 00:02:55,224
幻想は想像のまま 終われないんだ
These illusions cannot end just as mere imagination

4
00:02:55,574 --> 00:03:04,224
Diva! みんな今日を見に来てくれてありがとう！
Diva! Thank you everyone for coming to see me today!

5
00:03:06,314 --> 00:03:17,554
答えを延々と探し続けて 何者かになりたくて 潸々と降る夕立を ただ眺めた
Continuing to search endlessly for the answer, wanting to become someone special, I simply gazed at the pouring evening shower

6
00:03:17,804 --> 00:03:26,554
優しく寄り添って 心が晴れるのなら 翼が生えたような気がして いつだって隣にいるから
If gently leaning close clears your heart, it feels as though wings have grown, because I will always be right by your side

7
00:03:32,144 --> 00:03:37,954
だって言葉紡いで唄うことが わたしの運命だ
Because spinning words and singing is my destiny

8
00:03:38,054 --> 00:03:43,464
世界にありふれた虚しささえも 上書きして
Overwriting even the commonplace emptiness in this world

9
00:03:44,204 --> 00:03:52,754
路地裏に咲いた花のように 願いを照らす 小さな光に憧れて
Like a flower blooming in a back alley, yearning for a small light that illuminates wishes

10
00:04:06,400 --> 00:04:11,500
名前を持たない歌なんて 神様は認めてくれない
Even songs without a name, God will not acknowledge them

11
00:04:12,200 --> 00:04:16,800
一つ一つ枯れない花のよう
Like flowers that never wither, one by one

12
00:04:17,800 --> 00:04:23,000
昨日の自分にさよならして 溢れた涙
Saying goodbye to yesterday's self, the overflowing tears

13
00:04:23,800 --> 00:04:29,000
うまく笑えなくてもいいかな
It's okay even if you can't smile well

14
00:04:29,800 --> 00:04:34,500
だって理想は遠ざかってくばかり もう散々だよ
Because ideals just keep drifting further away, I'm already so exhausted

15
00:04:35,300 --> 00:04:40,200
どれだけ手を伸ばして叫んだって 届かないの
No matter how much I stretch out my hands and cry out, they don't reach

16
00:04:40,800 --> 00:04:51,200
望めばいつか叶うはずって信じてる どうか 歌よ響いて
Believing that someday it's bound to come true, please, let my song echo

17
00:04:55,100 --> 00:05:00,800
あぁ心臓の鼓動が今日も五月蝿い
Ah, the beating of my heart is so noisy again today

18
00:05:01,164 --> 00:05:05,484
Okey Dokey 返事はいいけど冗談なら笑えないよ
Okey Dokey, your response is fine, but I can't laugh at jokes!

19
00:05:05,864 --> 00:05:10,504
渋滞 曖昧 どっちを向いちゃうの蜃気楼に手を伸ばした
Traffic, ambiguity—which way are you looking? I reached out to a mirage.

20
00:05:10,504 --> 00:05:13,964
微熱のような夢物語
A dreamlike story like a slight fever...

21
00:05:13,964 --> 00:05:19,924
そんな光は見ない振りしていた
I used to pretend I didn't see such a light.

22
00:05:20,024 --> 00:05:24,004
ざわめく鼓動 まだ行かないで幻じゃ嫌だよ
Restless heartbeat, don't go yet—I hate the idea of an illusion.

23
00:05:24,004 --> 00:05:28,364
私を奪って魅惑の Dancing Dancing night
Steal me away, a fascinating dancing, dancing night!

24
00:05:28,364 --> 00:05:33,304
拡がって収まんない Universe
Spreading out and won't settle down, universe!

25
00:05:33,444 --> 00:05:37,524
君の表情は 私の森羅万象を
Your expression might rewrite...

26
00:05:37,524 --> 00:05:42,184
書き換えちゃうかも 責任重大ね
Rewriting my entire universe—what a heavy responsibility!

27
00:05:42,184 --> 00:05:48,224
一切合切 Dance Dance Dance We Are Dancing Reed
Everything, all at once! Dance, dance, dance, we are dancing reed!

28
00:05:48,224 --> 00:05:53,304
夢中になって絡み合った ゼログラビティ
Getting so absorbed and entwined—zero gravity!

29
00:05:53,304 --> 00:05:57,404
構わず Dance Dance Dance Just a Dance Just a Dance
Never mind, dance, dance, dance, just a dance, just a dance!

30
00:05:57,404 --> 00:06:01,544
声は闇に預けたまま
With my voice left entrusted to the darkness...

31
00:06:01,544 --> 00:06:05,724
目を覚ましても離れないで
Even when I wake up, don't let go.

32
