Maybe Needy? I'm not in my right mind—I can't forget your body heat.

46
00:07:28,464 --> 00:07:36,284
誰 彼 そんなじゃないから独り占めして Euphoria
It's not like it's just anyone—monopolize it in euphoria!

47
00:07:36,284 --> 00:07:43,424
気にしてない様な 言葉は装飾でメイクの様には流せない
Words like 'I don't care' are mere decoration; they can't be washed away like makeup.

48
00:07:43,424 --> 00:07:49,704
360°偽りだって隠しきれぬような
Even 360 degrees of falsehoods... like something you can't quite hide,

49
